  "promiseTrailQ2A": "The Sinai law repeated",
  "promiseTrailQ2B": "The new covenant in Jesus' blood",
  "promiseTrailQ2C": "A covenant only for the prophets",
  "promiseTrailQ2Correct": "Jeremiah promises a new covenant; at the supper, Jesus says it comes in his blood.",
